            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " We akagyenda orugyendo rw'eizooba ryona, akaza omu ihamba. Ku yaahikireyo, yaashutama ahansi y'omukinga, yaashaba Ruhanga ngu afe, naagira ati: Mperere hi! mbwenu, ai MUKAMA, nyita; ahakuba tiinyine ki ndikuhitsa baatatenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabyama ahansi y'omukinga, yaagwejegyera; bwanyima maraika yaija, yaamukoraho, yaamugira ati: Imuka orye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onu ku yaamagamagire, yaareeba aha mutwe gwe omugaati oguteekirwe aha mabaare garikwotsya, n'orunywero rw'amaizi. Yaarya, yaanywa, yaagaruka yaabyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maraika wa MUKAMA yaija obwa kabiri, yaamukoraho, yaagira ati: Imuka orye, orugyendo ni ruhango, rutakaakurema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
