                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eliya ku yaakahuriire, yaayeshweka omunagiro aha maisho, yaashohora, yaayemerera aha munwa gw'enyanga. Haija eiraka, ryamugira riti: Eliya nookora ki aha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagarukamu ati: Ngizire eihari ringi ahabwa MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe; ahabw'eokuba Abaisraeli baitsire endagaano yaawe, baasheenya amatambiro gaawe, na baanabi baawe baabaitsa rurara; nyowe, nyowe nyeka, niinye ntsigaireho; kandi naanye nibansherura kuunyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Irooko ogarukyeyo, otoore omuhanga gurikuza omu ihamba rya Damasiko; ku oraahikyeyo, oshukye amajuta ahari Hazaeli kuba omugabe wa Siria; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
