        {
          "text": " kandi na Yehu mwene Nimushi omushukyeho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli, na Elisa mwene Shafati owa Abeeli-mehoola, omushukyeho amajuta kuba nabi omu mwanya gwawe. ",
