        {
          "text": " Atyo yaarugayo, yaashanga Elisa mwene Shafati naahingisa ente makumi abiri na ina ezikomeraine ibiri-ibiri omu mishorongo ebiri, zimuri omumaisho, kwonka we aine ibiri ezirikuhereerukayo; Eliya yaakiikama; ku yaabaire naamurabaho, yaamunagaho omunagiro gwe. ",
