          "text": " Tiyaamukuratira, yaagarukayo, yaatwara ente ibiri, yaaziita, yaaziteekyesa ebiti ebyaba bizikomire, yaagaburira abantu, baarya. Bwanyima yaimuka, yaakurata Eliya, yaaguma naamuhereza.",
